title: "deflated-sharpe: Deflated and Probabilistic Sharpe Ratio in Python"
abstract: "A dependency-free Python implementation of the Deflated Sharpe Ratio, the Probabilistic Sharpe Ratio, the minimum track record length and the minimum backtest length, validated against every numerical example in the source papers."
type: software
